OL,3,GNEWSAACOTAR fans put real life on hold
OL,4,Afor latest release
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd with the release of A Court of
OL,7,FSplintered Harmony, Bray is prepared to
OL,8,Fput real life on hold, having booked an
OL,9,Fentire week off work to give herself
OL,10,Ftime to recover from whatever awaits
OL,11,Fher between the covers.
